OL,3,GNEWSARape and child sexual abuse       
OL,4,Aarrests in Presbyterian Church         
OL,5,Ainvestigation                          
OL,7,FTwo arrests as part of an investigation
OL,8,Finto safeguarding concerns at the      
OL,9,FPresbyterian Church in Ireland, were in
OL,10,Frelation to sexual communication with a
OL,11,Fchild and rape.                        
OL,13,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland 
OL,14,F(PSNI) said 168 people had now         
OL,15,Fcontacted police directly to report    
OL,16,Fconcerns, compared to 127 which was    
OL,17,Freported on 4 September.               
OL,19,FTheir investigation into the church was
OL,20,Fannounced in November last year.       
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
