OL,3,GNEWSARape and child sexual abuse       
OL,4,Aarrests in Presbyterian Church         
OL,5,Ainvestigation                          
OL,7,FIt came after the church said there    
OL,8,Fwere "serious and significant failings 
OL,9,Fin the central safeguarding functions  
OL,10,Fof the Presbyterian Church in Ireland  
OL,11,Ffrom the period 2009 to 2022".         
